WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
Take one.

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:06.971
I'm making this film because
I saw myself in your story.

00:00:06.971 --> 00:00:10.300
I just felt like I didn't
fit in with my family.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.030
My parents ran this
very controlling house.

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.920
I ran away a lot.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.607
Skateboarding was more
a family than my family.

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:23.350
How did you get disciplined?

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:28.120
Well, they call it
child abuse now, but.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.700
Life might be moving too fast.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.940
We have to fully grow
up and it's gonna suck.

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.740
When you're a kid, you just do.

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:37.090
You just act.

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:40.960
And then somewhere along the
line, everyone loses that.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:43.660
I knew you had some
huge weight on you.

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:45.340
Skateboarding meant more to you.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.740
It was kind of a
life-or-death thing.

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:50.120
I remember that screaming
coming from your room,

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:56.970
and it was, like,
really, really unnerving.

00:00:56.970 --> 00:01:00.840
One of the last things I said
to my dad was, I hate you.

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:03.510
You can't just have a
child and abandon them.

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:04.844
Life doesn't work like that.

00:01:04.844 --> 00:01:06.570
I just don't want him
to grow up like me.

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:08.260
I just want to hide.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:10.000
I just want to run away.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.670
That's what the
drinking is about.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:12.470
Maybe you're right.

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:13.950
Maybe I need to just move on.

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:20.820
I could seriously
be on the verge

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:22.500
of having a mental breakdown.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:28.340
But as long as I'm able to go
skate, I'm completely fine.

